% $Id$

% $Log$
% Revision 1.8  1998/03/11 15:02:55  dstotler
% Changed pm_check to match others (removed assert).
%
% Revision 1.7  1998/01/14 20:34:03  dstotler
% Change title phrase to aid readability of classes.web.
%
% Revision 1.6  1997/08/19 14:36:48  karney
% Changes to support compilation under f90.  This involved extensive changes
% in array.hweb and sysdep.web.  Nearly all other files needed some
% modifications.
%
% Revision 1.5  1996/05/24 18:50:02  dstotler
